      {
        "id": "thing-cerp",
        "moduleId": "thing-taxonomy",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "CERP-IoT 对 thing 的定义",
        "markdown": "CERP-IoT 的定义是：\n\n> A real/physical or digital/virtual entity that exists and moves in space and time and can be identified. Assigned identification numbers, names and location addresses commonly identify things.\n\n即“一个存在于时空中、会移动、且可被识别的真实/物理实体或数字/虚拟实体；通常用分配的识别号、名称和位置地址来识别”。\n\n教材提醒，文献中还会见到 “smart object”“device”“node” 等不同叫法。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
